To display a matrix as a bitmap with a zoom feature in Qt, you can follow these steps:

1. Create a QMatrix class to represent your matrix.
2. Create a QPixmap class to represent your bitmap.
3. Implement a zoom function that adjusts the size of the pixmap based on the user's input.
